<title>FRANCE: Elf Gabon H1 net attrib up 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Elf Gabon H1 net attrib up 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			    50.6  vs	    37.1</p>
<p>    Cashflow				     204.2  vs	   166.7</p>
<p>    Investments				   93.5  vs	    95.6</p>
<p>    Turnover				     507.5  vs	   450</p>
<p>NOTE - Elf Gabon said in a statement that the rise in turnover was due mainly to higher oil prices.</p>
<p>It said operating costs continue to drop close to 20 percent due to cost-cutting and the impact of prior asset sales.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
